data: {"id": "bd4636ddc3174c18-thinking-parallel_evidence-830", "run_id": "bd4636ddc3174c18", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将根据已有的基线结果，执行剩余的 evidence_plan 项（`kubectl_describe`、`query_pod_topology`）并补证 `previous logs`，以确认 **OOMKilled** 的具体原因。\n\n**已确认的关键事实：**\n- **Metrics**: Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，最后终止原因为 **OOMKilled**，重启 **27次**。\n- **Logs**: 日志中大量出现 `aiops.observed_mode=oom_growth` 以及 `memory allocation advanced`。\n\n**待执行计划：**\n1. `kubectl_describe`: 获取 Pod 的详细生命周期信息（Restart Reason, Exit Code）。\n2. `query_pod_topology`: 获取拓扑关系。\n3. `kubectl_previous_logs`: 获取上一次崩溃前的完整日志。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789085963337, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

